    "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/ISS-20_Thunderstorms_on_the_Brazilian_Horizon.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
    "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ISS-20_Thunderstorms_on_the_Brazilian_Horizon.jpg",
